{
  "id": "MODEL-PSR-EMPTY-WORLD",
  "description": "An unpopulated possible world whose candidate domain is inhabited. Its universal existence-PSR and external-causation predicates are true vacuously, its causal relation is well-founded, and it has no explained existent.",
